  ],
  "usage": "Use for a death, knockout, defeat, mati, or tumbang animation on the current Rhino rig. Duration is 42 frames at 30 FPS (1.4 seconds). This is a one-shot terminal action, not a loop. The fall uses easeIn (gravity acceleration) from frames 10 to 24; the landing uses easeOut (impact deceleration) from frames 30 to 36. The body rotates 82 degrees forward and drops 38 units. After frame 42 the character is completely still. The sword is attached to the right hand (bone ID 3) and goes limp with the arm. The source rig has two bones named right_arm: ID 2 is the upper arm (parent ID 1), and ID 3 is the right hand (parent ID 2, carrying sword ID 9). Apply tracks by boneId on this rig; name-only mapping cannot distinguish these tracks. Eyes and sword retain their local transforms and inherit their parents' motion.",
